                <head>No. 446<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>A letter of December 7 from Prime Minister Churchill to President Eisenhower and
                    the President’s reply of December 14, both of which pertain in part to China,
                    are scheduled for publication in <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v06p1">volume
                        VI</ref>.</p>
            </div>
